<title>USA: Immunomedics, Mallinckrodt launch imaging agent.</title>
<headline>Immunomedics, Mallinckrodt launch imaging agent.</headline>
<dateline>MORRIS PLAINS, N.J. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Immunomedics Inc and Mallinckrodt Group Inc said Tuesday that CEA-Scan, an imaging agent for diagnosing colorectal cancer, is now being sold in the United States.</p>
<p>Immunomedics is the products manufacturer. Mallinckrodt, based in St. Louis, is the marketer.</p>
<p>CEA-Scan was cleared for marketing in the United States on June 28.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
